    "content": "<p>Heads up, Pilots! The <a href=\"https://warrobotsfrontiers.com/news/201\">Smuggler&rsquo;s Run Battle Pass</a> will now end on June 16 <strong>(08:00 UTC/10:00 CEST/01:00 PT),</strong> giving you more time to fight for incredible rewards.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"embeddedContent oembed-provider-youtube\" data-align=\"center\" data-oembed=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PxDXrx9Lls8\" data-oembed_provider=\"youtube\" data-resizetype=\"noresize\" style=\"text-align:center\"><iframe allowfullscreen=\"true\" allowscriptaccess=\"always\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" src=\"//www.youtube.com/embed/PxDXrx9Lls8?wmode=transparent&amp;jqoemcache=1KuaD\"></iframe></div>\r\n\r\n<p>Along with the <strong>Scorpion </strong>War Robot and <strong>Tusk </strong>Weapons, you&rsquo;ll also find plenty of cosmetic rewards within the Battle Pass, including <strong>Paints</strong>, <strong>Decals</strong>, and <strong>Stickers</strong>, to customize your builds to the max.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>That&rsquo;s not all, as the Battle Pass also grants you access to unlocking valuable in-game currency such as <strong>Salvage </strong>and <strong>Credits</strong>, which you can use to upgrade your Drop Team, recruit new Pilots, and more.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Grab the Smuggler&rsquo;s Run Battle Pass, and fight for fantastic rewards until <strong>June 16</strong>!&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n<p><strong>Download War Robots: Frontiers for free today:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://warrobotsfrontiers.com/l/playstation\"><strong>PlayStation&reg;5</strong></a><strong>│</strong><a href=\"https://warrobotsfrontiers.com/l/playstation\"><strong>PlayStation&reg;4</strong></a><strong>│ </strong><a href=\"https://warrobotsfrontiers.com/l/xbox\"><strong>Xbox Series X|S&trade;</strong></a><strong> │</strong><a href=\"https://warrobotsfrontiers.com/l/xbox\"><strong>Xbox One&trade;</strong></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://warrobotsfrontiers.com/l/steam\"><strong>Steam</strong></a><strong> │ </strong><a href=\"https://my.games/play/war_robots_frontiers_mg\"><strong>MY.GAMES Launcher</strong></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Stay tuned to our official <a href=\"https://x.com/WRFrontiers\">X</a>, <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/wrfrontiers\">Facebook</a>, <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/wrfrontiers/\">Instagram</a>, <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC7xxqQkPAQ7x6wIVEPZus5w\">YouTube</a>, and <a href=\"https://www.tiktok.com/@wrfrontiers\">TikTok</a> channels, and join the <a href=\"https://www.reddit.com/r/warrobotsfrontiers/\">War Robots: Frontiers subreddit</a> and <a href=\"https://warrobotsfrontiers.com/l/discord\">Discord</a> for all the latest news and updates.</p>",
